# text = Will Monsieur Creemsvort favour me by attending to this hint Pardon me , monsieur , if I venture to add that what I have just said is of importance to the poor girl ; she already experiences great difficulty in impressing these giddy young things with a due degree of deference for her authority , and should that difficulty be increased by new discoveries of her incapacity , she might find her position in my establishment too painful to be retained ; a circumstance I should much regret for her sake , as she can ill afford to lose the profits of her occupation here
