# text = You will observe , monsieur , and tell me what you think ; I could so much better rely on your opinion than on my own ; women cannot judge of these things as men can , and , excuse my pertinacity , monsieur , but it is natural I should feel interested about this poor little girl ( pauvre petite ); she has scarcely any relations , her own efforts are all she has to look to , her acquirements must be her sole fortune ; her present position has once been mine , or nearly so ; it is then but natural I should sympathize with her ; and sometimes when I see the difficulty she has in managing pupils , I reel quite chagrined .
