# text = In Switzerland I have done but little , learnt but little , and seen but little ; my life there was in a circle ; I walked the same round every day ; I could not get out of it ; had I rested -- remained there even till my death , I should never have enlarged it , because I am poor and not skilful , I have not great acquirements ; when I was quite tired of this round , I begged my aunt to go to Brussels ; my existence is no larger here , because I am no richer or higher ; I walk in as narrow a limit , but the scene is changed ; it would change again if I went to England .
