# text = The rough-shod foot treads most firmly on slippery ground Mademoiselle Henri has left your establishment -- been dismissed , I presume Ah , I wished to have a little conversation with you , monsieur but we cannot talk quietly here ; will Monsieur step into the garden a minute There There , one feels quiet and free when there are only pear-trees and rose-bushes about one ; I dare say you , like me , monsieur , are sometimes tired of being eternally in the midst of life ; of having human faces always round you , human eyes always upon you , human voices always in your ear .
