# text = How lucky I am !' to attract the attention and envy of my neighbours -- I am merely passive ; but when events fall out ill -- when circumstances become adverse -- I watch very vigilantly ; I knit on still , and still I hold my tongue ; but every now and then , monsieur , I just put my toe out -- so -- and give the rebellious circumstance a little secret push , without noise , which sends it the way I wish , and I am successful after all , and nobody has seen my expedient .
# sent_id = 403
