# text = So , when teachers or masters become troublesome and inefficient -- when , in short , the interests of the school would suffer from their retaining their places -- I mind my knitting , events progress , circumstances glide past ; I see one which , if pushed ever so little awry , will render untenable the post I wish to have vacated -- the deed is done -- the stumbling-block removed -- and no one saw me : I have not made an enemy , I am rid of an incumbrance Just like you And in this way you have ousted Mdlle .
