# text = I was sorry for that circumstance when heavier troubles ought to have made me forget it Your aunt is dead Yes , a fortnight since , and she died full of regret , which I could not chase from her mind ; she kept repeating , even during the last night of her existence , ' Frances , you will be so lonely when I am gone , so friendless :' she wished too that she could have been buried in Switzerland , and it was I who persuaded her in her old age to leave the banks of Lake Leman , and to come , only as it seems to die , in this flat region of Flanders .
