# text = With you she will sit silent as long as it suits you to talk alone ; you can hold her under a potent spell : intelligent as she is , eloquent as she can be , you can seal her lips , and veil her bright countenance with diffidence ; yet , you know , she is not all monotonous mildness ; you have seen , with a sort of strange pleasure , revolt , scorn , austerity , bitterness , lay energetic claim to a place in her feelings and physiognomy ; you know that few could rule her as you do ; you know she might break , but never bend under the hand of Tyranny and Injustice , but Reason and Affection can guide her by a sign .
